<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    color: #333;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "Liberation Sans", "DejaVu Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .logo-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    margin-right: 10px;
  }
  .university-name {
    font-size: 24pt;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .campus-recreation {
    font-size: 12pt;
    margin-top: -10px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 16pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .content-block {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .form-label {
    flex-basis: 150px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .form-input {
    flex-grow: 1;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .radio-group label {
    margin-right: 20px;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 50px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .signature-box {
    width: 45%;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <div class="logo-icon"></div>
    <div>
      <div class="university-name">WEBER STATE UNIVERSITY</div>
      <div class="campus-recreation">Campus Recreation</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Swim Lesson Grant Criteria</div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> The purpose of Weber State Campus Recreation's Learn to Swim Grant program is to provide opportunities for families that experience financial hardship to access swim lessons. Swim lessons save lives, and everyone should have the opportunity to learn to swim regardless of ability, age, gender, nationality, race, socioeconomic status, or other factors. This grant program will specifically be targeted to the communities surrounding Weber State.</p>
    <p><strong>Criteria:</strong> In order to qualify for a swim lesson grant, applicants must meet one or more of the following qualifications:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Must be a resident of <span data-field="residency_area_1">{{ residency_area_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="residency_area_2">{{ residency_area_2 }}</span>, or Box Elder counties</li>
      <li>AND</li>
      <li>Participant in Free and Reduced Lunch program or</li>
      <li>Participant in Head Start Program or</li>
      <li>Medicaid, SSI, TANF, WIC, Food Stamps or other public assistance programs</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Grants will be awarded each semester and recipients will enroll in lessons each month of the award period.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Fall (<span data-field="fall_month_range">{{ fall_month_range }}</span>) Application Deadline: <span data-field="fall_deadline">{{ fall_deadline }}</span></li>
      <li>Spring (<span data-field="spring_month_range">{{ spring_month_range }}</span>) Application Deadline: <span data-field="spring_deadline">{{ spring_deadline }}</span></li>
      <li>Summer (<span data-field="summer_month_range">{{ summer_month_range }}</span>) Application Deadline: <span data-field="summer_deadline">{{ summer_deadline }}</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p>The number of grants awarded each semester will depend on the funding available. The amount of funding awarded will depend on need and number of children in each applicant family. Grants are for group swim lessons only, except in extenuating circumstances.</p>

    <div class="section-title">Application Process:</div>
    <ol>
      <li>Applicants will complete the pdf form</li>
      <li>With the application form, provide proof of the qualifying income-assistance service received</li>
      <li>The paperwork can be submitted one of the following ways:
        <ul>
          <li>Drop off in person at the Wildcat Center (<span data-field="center_address">{{ center_address }}</span>)</li>
          <li>Email it to <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></li>
          <li>Mail:</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li><span data-field="application_review_period">{{ application_review_period }}</span></li>
      <li>Families who have received grants will be given instructions on how to enroll in swim lessons, and must do so within 1 week of receiving the grant.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <div class="logo-icon"></div>
    <div>
      <div class="university-name">WEBER STATE UNIVERSITY</div>
      <div class="campus-recreation">Campus Recreation</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Approval Process:</div>
  <ol>
    <li>Fully completed applications will be reviewed by an internal committee of Weber State University.</li>
    <li>The committee will issue a decision approving or denying the applications.</li>
    <li>The committee may return the application to applicant for clarification or request additional documentation.</li>
    <li>The committee has the discretion to consider any additional information that it deems relevant.</li>
    <li>The funds available for the grants are limited. When the allocated funds reach a 90% exhausted level, no additional scholarships will be awarded until the fund is replenished.</li>
    <li>Every reasonable effort will be made to protect the privacy of the applicants.</li>
    <li>Grants will be awarded solely on the basis of financial need. Weber State University will not discriminate on the basis of race, color, ethnic origin, national origin, creed, religion, political belief, sex, sexual orientation, marital status, or age.</li>
    <li>Approved grants will be applied only to the session for which they were requested. Any future grant requests will require submission of a separate application.</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="section-title">Grant Responsibilities</div>
  <ol>
    <li>Anyone receiving a grant and failing to use it prevents another applicant from having a grant. Grant recipients must attend all of the classes for which the grant was approved. Failure to attend classes may result in termination of the grant and denial of future grant opportunities.</li>
    <li>Recipients and their family members are required to comply with all Weber State University policies.</li>
    <li>If there is a legitimate reason that a recipient is unable to attend classes, a written explanation must be submitted as soon as possible to the Aquatics Program, along with necessary documentation (such as a doctor's note).</li>
  </ol>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <div class="logo-icon"></div>
    <div>
      <div class="university-name">WEBER STATE UNIVERSITY</div>
      <div class="campus-recreation">Campus Recreation</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Swim Lesson Grant Application</div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <p>Complete all sections of this application and return it, with required documentation. Your application will be presented to the Weber State Swim Lesson Grant Committee for review. Please understand that funds are limited. Every reasonable effort will be made to allocate funds fairly and keep applications confidential.</p>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Applicant's Name:</div>
      <div class="form-input"><span data-field="applicant_full_name">{{ applicant_full_name }}</span></div>
      <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 30px;">Phone:</div>
      <div class="form-input" style="width: 150px;"><span data-field="applicant_phone">{{ applicant_phone }}</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Home Address:</div>
      <div class="form-input"><span data-field="applicant_address">{{ applicant_address }}</span></div>
      <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 30px;">City:</div>
      <div class="form-input" style="width: 150px;"><span data-field="applicant_city">{{ applicant_city }}</span></div>
      <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 30px;">State:</div>
      <div class="form-input" style="width: 100px;"><span data-field="applicant_state">{{ applicant_state }}</span></div>
      <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 30px;">Zip Code:</div>
      <div class="form-input" style="width: 100px;"><span data-field="applicant_zip_code">{{ applicant_zip_code }}</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Email:</div>
      <div class="form-input"><span data-field="applicant_email">{{ applicant_email }}</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Desired Session:</div>
      <div class="radio-group">
        <label><input type="radio" name="session" value="Fall"> Fall</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="session" value="Spring"> Spring</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="session" value="Summer"> Summer</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">Medical Information:</div>
    <div class="content-block">
      <p>Does the participant have a medical condition that instructors should be aware of?</p>
      <div class="radio-group">
        <label><input type="radio" name="medical_condition" value="Yes"> Yes</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="medical_condition" value="No"> No</label>
      </div>
      <p>If yes, please explain:</p>
      <div class="form-input" style="height: 80px; border: 1px solid #000;" data-field="if_yes_please_explain">{{ if_yes_please_explain }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">Participants</div>
    <p>Please list all participants you wish to be a part of the grant:</p>

    {% for i in range(3) %}
    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 15px;">
      <div class="form-row">
        <div class="form-label">Name:</div>
        <div class="form-input"><span data-field="participant_{{ i }}_name">{{ participant_i_name }}</span></div>
        <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 30px;">Birthdate:</div>
        <div class="form-input" style="width: 150px;"><span data-field="participant_{{ i }}_birthdate">{{ participant_i_birthdate }}</span></div>
        <div class="form-label" style="margin-left: 30px;">Sex:</div>
        <div class="form-input" style="width: 100px;"><span data-field="participant_{{ i }}_sex">{{ participant_i_sex }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}

    <div class="content-block">
      <p>Please provide documentation of the following:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Participant in Free and Reduced Lunch program, Participant in Head Start Program or Medicaid, SSI, TANF, WIC, Food Stamps or other public assistance programs</li>
        <li>Proof of residency for one of the following counties: <span data-field="residency_county_1">{{ residency_county_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="residency_county_2">{{ residency_county_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="residency_county_3">{{ residency_county_3 }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="signature-line">
      <div class="signature-box">Applicant Signature:</div>
      <div class="signature-box">Date:</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>